<meta name="Generator" content="Microsoft Word">
<title>यात्रा भत्ता आवेदन - Travelling Allowance Form</title>
<style>
@page { size: A4; margin: 1.5cm 1.2cm; }
body { font-family: "Mangal", "Nirmala UI", "Arial Unicode MS", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #000; }
.center { text-align: center; }
.bold { font-weight: bold; }
.hindi { font-family: "Mangal", "Nirmala UI", "Arial Unicode MS", sans-serif; }
table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 8px 0; }
td, th { border: 1px solid #000; padding: 4px 6px; vertical-align: top; font-size: 10pt; }
.no-border td, .no-border th { border: none; }
.field-line { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; min-height: 18px; display: inline-block; width: 100%; }
.section-title { font-weight: bold; margin: 12px 0 6px; }
.small { font-size: 9pt; }
.checkbox { font-family: Segoe UI Symbol, Arial; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="center bold hindi">
<div>राष्ट्रीय इलेक्ट्रॉनिकी एवं सूचना प्रौद्योगिकी संस्थान</div>
<div>National Institute of Electronics &amp; Information Technology (NIELIT)</div>
<div class="small">इलेक्ट्रॉनिकी और सूचना प्रौद्योगिकी मंत्रालय, भारत सरकार</div>
<div class="small">Ministry of Electronics &amp; Information Technology, Government of India</div>
</div>

<div class="center bold hindi" style="margin-top:14px; font-size:13pt;">
यात्रा भत्ता आवेदन / Travelling Allowance Form
</div>

<div class="section-title hindi checkbox">&#9670; दावेदार का विवरण / Claimant Details:-</div>
<table class="no-border" style="width:100%;">
<tr><td class="hindi" style="width:38%;">दावेदार का नाम / Name of Claimant:</td><td><span class="field-line">&nbsp;</span></td></tr>
<tr><td class="hindi">पदनाम / Designation:</td><td><span class="field-line">&nbsp;</span></td></tr>
<tr><td class="hindi">वेतन / Pay:</td><td><span class="field-line" style="width:30%;">&nbsp;</span> <span class="hindi">स्तर / Level</span> <span class="field-line" style="width:15%;">&nbsp;</span> <span class="hindi">सेल / Cell</span> <span class="field-line" style="width:30%;">&nbsp;</span></td></tr>
<tr><td class="hindi">आधिकारिक पता / Official Address:</td><td><span class="field-line">&nbsp;</span></td></tr>
<tr><td class="hindi">यात्रा का उद्देश्य / Purpose of Journey:</td><td><span class="field-line">&nbsp;</span></td></tr>
</table>

<div class="section-title hindi checkbox">&#9670; खाते में अंतरित करने के लिए [अनिवार्य] / For Account Transfer [Mandatory]:-</div>
<table class="no-border" style="width:100%;">
<tr><td class="hindi" style="width:38%;">पैन / PAN:</td><td><span class="field-line">&nbsp;</span></td></tr>
<tr><td class="hindi">ईमेल / E-Mail ID:</td><td><span class="field-line">&nbsp;</span></td></tr>
<tr><td class="hindi">संपर्क सूत्र / Mobile No.:</td><td><span class="field-line">&nbsp;</span></td></tr>
<tr><td class="hindi">बैंक का नाम व शाखा / Name and Branch of Bank:</td><td><span class="field-line">&nbsp;</span></td></tr>
<tr><td class="hindi">आई एफ सी कोड / IFSC Code:</td><td><span class="field-line">&nbsp;</span></td></tr>
<tr><td class="hindi">खाता संख्या / Account Number:</td><td><span class="field-line">&nbsp;</span></td></tr>
</table>

<div class="section-title">A) <span class="hindi">यात्रा भत्ता / Travelling Allowance:-</span></div>
<table>
<tr>
<th class="hindi small" colspan="2">प्रस्थान<br>Departure</th>
<th class="hindi small" colspan="2">आगमन<br>Arrival</th>
<th class="hindi small" rowspan="2">यात्रा का<br>तरीका<br>Mode of Travel</th>
<th class="hindi small" rowspan="2">श्रेणी<br>Class</th>
<th class="hindi small" rowspan="2">दूरी<br>(कि.मी. / K.M.)<br>Distance</th>
<th class="hindi small" rowspan="2">भुगतान<br>किया या<br>कराया<br>Fare Paid</th>
<th class="hindi small" colspan="3">यात्रा विवरण / Journey Details<br><span class="small">यदि यात्रा टैक्सी / कार द्वारा की गई, कृपया निर्दिष्ट करें<br>(If Travelled by Taxi / Car, Please indicate)</span></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class="hindi small">दिनांक व<br>समय<br>Date &amp; Time</th>
<th class="hindi small">स्टेशन /<br>स्थान<br>Station / Place</th>
<th class="hindi small">दिनांक व<br>समय<br>Date &amp; Time</th>
<th class="hindi small">स्टेशन /<br>स्थान<br>Station / Place</th>
<th class="hindi small">वाहन<br>क्रमांक<br>Vehicle No.</th>
<th class="hindi small">यात्रा<br>कि.मी.<br>KM Travelled</th>
<th class="hindi small">क्या साझा<br>किया या<br>Whether Shared</th>
<th class="hindi small">राशि<br>Amount</th>
</tr>
<tr><td style="height:28px;">&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr>
<tr><td style="height:28px;">&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr>
<tr><td style="height:28px;">&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr>
<tr><td style="height:28px;">&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr>
</table>
<p class="small">(Note:- TA is applicable for the shortest route only)</p>

<div class="section-title">(B) <span class="hindi">खाद्य बिल दावे / Food Bill Claim (If Applicable):-</span></div>
<table>
<tr>
<th class="hindi">दावे की तिथि / Date for which claim made</th>
<th class="hindi">राशि / Amount</th>
