<div class="section-title">(C) <span class="hindi">होटल आवास लागत / Cost of Hotel Accommodation (If Stayed):-</span></div>
<table>
<tr>
<th class="hindi">होटल का नाम एवं पता<br>Name and Address of Hotel</th>
<th class="hindi">अवधि / Period<br>से / From</th>
<th class="hindi">तक / To</th>
<th class="hindi">दिनों की संख्या<br>No. of Days</th>
<th class="hindi">दर / Rate</th>
<th class="hindi">जीएसटी / GST</th>
<th class="hindi">राशि / Amount</th>
</tr>
<tr><td style="height:28px;">&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr>
<tr><td style="height:28px;">&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr>
<tr>
