</td>
<td style="width:50%; vertical-align:top;">
<div class="hindi bold">पर्यवेक्षण अधिकारी / विभागाध्यक्ष / पीआई / समन्वयक के हस्ताक्षर</div>
<div class="small">Signature of the supervising officer / HoD / PI / Coordinator</div>
<div class="hindi" style="margin-top:8px;">नाम / Name: <span class="field-line">&nbsp;</span></div>
<div class="hindi">पद / Designation: <span class="field-line">&nbsp;</span></div>
<div class="hindi">विभाग / Department: <span class="field-line">&nbsp;</span></div>
<div class="hindi">कर्मचारी आईडी / Emp. ID: <span class="field-line">&nbsp;</span></div>
</td>
</tr>
</table>

